### ==========================================
### 时区管理 — Timezone
### 路径前缀：/system/timezone
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000

### ------------------- 获取时区选项列表 -------------------
### @name Get Timezone Options
# 返回系统支持的所有时区选项
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/timezone/options HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 获取当前时区 -------------------
### @name Get Current Timezone
# 返回当前用户设置的时区
GET {{baseUrl}}/system/timezone/current HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------- 设置时区 -------------------
### @name Set Timezone
POST {{baseUrl}}/system/timezone/set HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timezone": "Asia/Shanghai"
}
